\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/09FU}{\texttt{Stacks tag 09FU}}


If $F$ is a field and $R$ is a nonzero ring, then any ring homomorphism
$\varphi : F \to R$ is injective.

\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/09G5}{\texttt{Stacks tag 09G5}}


