\href{https://stacks.math.columbia.edu/tag/0H85}{\texttt{Stacks tag 0H85}}


Let $R$ be a ring and $f \in R$. Let $M \in D(R)$. Assume
\begin{enumerate}
\item $H^i(M) = 0$ for $i > 0$,
\item $M \otimes_R^\mathbf{L} R_f$ is isomorphic to a flat $R_f$-module
